File: python/libxml.c
Line: 2357
Function: libxml_prev
Bug type: null-pointer-dereference
CWE: CWE-476
Explanation: cur is obtained via PyxmlNode_Get(obj) and dereferenced (cur->type) without a NULL check. If PyxmlNode_Get returns NULL for an invalid input object, this causes a crash.

